{
  "_comment": "Tier policy for the autonomous-VJ OSC gateway, built from the Arena 7.22.4 REST digest of 2026-10-05. Default DENY; tier-3 deny always wins. '*' = one path segment, '**' = any depth, '{1,2,4}' = alternation. OSC addresses are DERIVED from REST keys: every rule is verified=false until a live OSC round-trip test passes, and unverified rules are refused when VJ_ENABLE=1. Only tempo is verified, and magi-audio owns tempo (not in this gateway). Tier-1 float values are given in NATIVE units and normalized by 'range' (v-min)/(max-min) before sending.",
